WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/dashboard/components/WidgetSettingsModal.tsx — a Modal (web `Modal size=sm`,
  title `${def.name} Settings`) editing a widget's controlled `config` (web `useState(widget.config ?? {})`):
    • Vehicle      (when `isVehicleWidget = category !== 'system' && !== 'analytics'`): web `Select`,
                   value `config.vehicleId?.toString() ?? 'all'`; options 'all'→"All Vehicles (first)"
                   then each `useVehicles()` row → `v.display_name || \`Vehicle ${v.id}\``;
                   onChange `'all' ? undefined : Number(val)`.
    • Refresh      (always): web `Select`, value `refreshRate?.toString() ?? 'default'`; options
                   default / 5 / 15 / 30 / 60 s; onChange `'default' ? undefined : Number(val)`.
    • Time Range   (when `isChartWidget = category ∈ {driving,charging,analytics,battery}`): web `Select`,
                   value `timeRange ?? '7d'`; options 24h / 7d / 30d / 90d.
    • Appearance   (always): web `Toggle`, label "Show widget title", checked `showTitle !== false`.
    • Footer       : Cancel (web `onClose`) + Save (web `handleSave → onSave(config); onClose()`).
  Data sources: useVehicles, useTranslation. Shared components: @/components/ui (Modal/Select/Toggle/
  Button), @/components/forms (FormSection). Charts/maps: none.

